<title>UK: Ship with maize for S.Korea refloated in Argentina.</title>
<headline>Ship with maize for S.Korea refloated in Argentina.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bulk carrier Panayia Moutsaina, loaded with 42,755 tonnes of maize, went aground in the San Pedro Basin, Argentina on April 28 but was refloated on Wednesday, Lloyds Shipping Intelligence Service said.</p>
<p>The Greek-registered 66,908 dwt bulker loaded at San Pedro on April 28 and ran aground the same day. It is bound for South Korea.</p>
</text>
